@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@transportOrderId = 1
@deliveryId = 1
@omlastInventoryId = 1

### Load read-only legacy Omlast/direkt modal context; Save in the modal only changes the client draft
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transportorder/{{transportOrderId}}/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/omlast-info

### Preview unsaved delivery ordering without replacing saved legs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transportorder/{{transportOrderId}}/route-preview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deliveries": [
    { "id": {{deliveryId}}, "sortOrder": 1 }
  ]
}

### Recalculate and persist the saved transport order's legs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transportorder/{{transportOrderId}}/route/recalculate

### Preview a forced transshipment without saving transport-order settings
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transportorder/{{transportOrderId}}/route-preview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deliveries": [
    {
      "id": {{deliveryId}},
      "sortOrder": 1,
      "forcedOmlastStatus": 1,
      "omlastInventoryId": {{omlastInventoryId}}
    }
  ]
}

### Invalid transport order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transportorder/999999999/route/recalculate
